sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Caller
    participant L as Leader
    participant W as Workers (N shards)

    C->>L: run(total_images, batches, worker_count)
    L->>W: create shard group
    L->>W: init (shard_id, image share)
    W-->>L: ok

    loop each batch round
        L->>W: classify (scatter to all shards)
        W->>W: fake model pass<br/>(score per image, pick label)
        W-->>L: predictions + timings
    end

    L->>L: merge predictions,<br/>compute efficiency & per-node stats
    L-->>C: final report
